  "title": "Treaty of Versailles",
  "summary": "The Treaty of Versailles was signed on 28 June 1919 at Versailles, closing the Paris Peace Conference, between the Allied and Associated Powers and Germany. Its 440 articles in 15 parts capped the German army at 100,000 men, cost Germany 13 percent of its territory and made it accept responsibility for the war. The treaty also established the League of Nations.",
